sequenceDiagram
 actor Customer
 participant UI
 participant API
 participant RP as Razorpay
 participant Store
 Customer->>UI: Choose amount
 UI->>API: POST /razorpay/orders
 API->>API: Validate and build INR order
 API->>RP: Create order with server secret
 RP-->>API: Order id, amount, currency
 API->>Store: Register pending order
 API-->>UI: Order and public key id
 UI->>RP: Open hosted checkout
 RP-->>UI: Payment id and signature
 UI->>API: POST /razorpay/verify
 API->>API: Verify HMAC and captured payment
 API->>Store: Credit once and append ledger entry
 API-->>UI: Verified balance
